# Move: The Move Book (Sui and Aptos dialects): language reference; requirements/languages/move.md
name     move
keyword  module script fun public entry native struct has copy drop store key use friend acquires
keyword  move copy let mut if else while loop break continue return abort const spec as Self
type     u8 u16 u32 u64 u128 u256 bool address signer vector
builtin  true false borrow_global borrow_global_mut exists move_to move_from assert
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
prefix   b x
sigil    @    : num
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
